==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|борозда}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*borzda}}. {{doublet|ru|бразда́}}, a borrowing from Old Church Slavonic.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|борозда́}}
